OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA band of
OL,6,Fcloud and rain, locally heavy, will
OL,7,Fmove southeast across the region this
OL,8,Fevening and overnight, gradually
OL,9,Fclearing during the early hours.
OL,10,FBecoming drier with clearer spells
OL,11,Ffollowing on behind. Feeling
OL,12,Fnoticeably cooler with lighter winds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FA chilly start to Friday,
OL,15,Fleading to a drier and brighter day
OL,16,Fwith plenty of sunny spells, although
OL,17,Fwith a risk of showers. Feeling
OL,18,Fnoticeably cooler in the northwesterly
OL,19,Fbreeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
